## Rate Limit Handling

Gemini API free-tier accounts may have request-per-minute limits.

The application includes automatic handling for:

```text
429 RESOURCE_EXHAUSTED
```

When the API rate limit is reached, the program detects the error, waits for the recommended retry period, and retries automatically.

The agent is also designed to minimize unnecessary searches and Gemini API requests.

## Research Agent Architecture

```text
User Research Topic
        |
        v
Google Gemini
        |
        v
Tool Decision
   /          \
  v            v
Web Search   Web Scraper
  |            |
  +-----+------+
        |
        v
Collected Web Evidence
        |
        v
Gemini Analysis
        |
        v
Structured Research Report
      /       \
     v         v
 Markdown     PDF
```

