## Security

Never expose API keys in source code.

Keep sensitive information inside:

```text
.env
```

and ensure `.env` is included in `.gitignore`.

If an API key is accidentally uploaded to GitHub, revoke it immediately and create a new one.

## Disclaimer

The reports generated by this project are AI-assisted and depend on information retrieved from third-party websites. Important information should always be independently verified before being used for academic, professional, financial, legal, or other high-impact decisions.

